#|
This is the layout of my Aula F75.
I changed Fn to ralt such that i could modify it's behavior.
The reason that i chose ralt was to make it work with my laptop as well (Asus K571GT)
|#

(defsrc
  esc   f1    f2    f3    f4    f5    f6    f7    f8    f9    f10   f11   f12
  grv   1    2    3    4    5    6    7    8    9    0    -    =    bspc  del
  tab   q    w    e    r    t    y    u    i    o    p    [    ]    \     pgup
  caps  a    s    d    f    g    h    j    k    l    ;    '    ret        pgdn
  lsft  z    x    c    v    b    n    m    ,    .    /    rsft      up    end
  lctl lmet lalt           spc                 ralt rctl      lft   down  rght
)
